## 📋 Project Context

**Project Name:** School Management System  
**Tech Stack:** Next.js 14, React, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS  
**Target Users:** Teachers, Students, Parents, Administrators  
**Design Philosophy:** Modern, Clean, Professional, User-Friendly

