## Component-Specific Design Rules

### **Sidebar (Dashboard)**
- Background: `bg-gradient-to-b from-indigo-600 to-purple-600`
- Text: `text-white`
- Active item: `bg-white text-indigo-600 shadow-lg`
- Hover: `hover:bg-white/10`
- Width: `w-64` (expanded), `w-20` (collapsed)

### **Header/Navigation**
- Background: `bg-white`
- Border: `border-b border-gray-200`
- Sticky: `sticky top-0 z-10`
- Shadow: `shadow-sm`

### **Tables**
- Header: `bg-gray-50`
- Row hover: `hover:bg-gray-50`
- Border: `border-b border-gray-100`
- Header text: `text-sm font-semibold text-gray-600`

### **Forms**
- Label: `text-sm font-medium text-gray-700`
- Error text: `text-sm text-red-500`
- Focus ring: `focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500`

### **Modals/Overlays**
- Backdrop: `bg-black/50`
- Container: `bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-xl`
- Max width: `max-w-md` or `max-w-2xl`

