## Color Usage Guidelines

### **When to Use Each Color**

#### Indigo (Primary)
- Primary buttons and CTAs
- Active navigation items
- Grade badges
- Important stats
- Links and interactive elements

#### Purple (Secondary)
- Gradients combined with indigo
- Secondary emphasis
- Decorative elements

#### Green
- Success states
- Active status
- High performance (90%+ attendance)
- Completed assignments
- Positive trends

#### Orange/Yellow
- Warning states
- Attention needed (75-89% attendance)
- Pending items
- Moderate priority

#### Red
- Error states
- Critical issues (< 75% attendance)
- Overdue items
- Delete actions

#### Gray
- Text hierarchy
- Borders and dividers
- Disabled states
- Backgrounds

